# PROJECT: SKILIVO — GLOBAL LEARNING & SKILL-SHARING PLATFORM

Act as a world-class product designer, senior full-stack software engineer, UI/UX specialist, database architect, cybersecurity engineer, and startup technology consultant.

Your task is to design and develop a complete, professional, responsive, scalable web application called **SKILIVO**.

Do not create an ordinary educational website. Build a modern global technology platform that combines an online learning marketplace with a social networking experience.

The platform should connect people who want to learn with people who have the knowledge, experience, and skills to teach.

The experience should combine the best qualities of platforms like Udemy, Coursera, LinkedIn, and modern online communities, while maintaining its own unique identity.

